'''Tày Tấc''' (Tai Tâk) is a [[Southwestern Tai languages|Southwestern Tai language]] spoken in Mường Tấc District (Muang Tâk), eastern [[Sơn La Province]], [[Vietnam]], where it is also referred to as White Tay.<ref>{{harvp|Donaldson|Edmondson|1997|page=235}}</ref>

